            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for making an issue!\r\n\r\nThe reason this is happening is that with `y1<CR>` you are using `<CR>` in Operator-Pending mode. By default it is mapped to `MiniJump2d.start()` in that mode also, but you seem to expect its default motion (\"[count] lines downward, on the first non-blank character |linewise|\").\r\n\r\nThere are several options here:\r\n- Use `y2_` instead of `y1<CR>`.\r\n- Use different mapping to start jumping. For example, `  require('mini.jump2d').setup({ mappings = { start_jumping = '<M-m>' } })`.\r\n\r\nDoes this solve your issue?",
